WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.567
-Guys, do you ever see a photo
in the news and go,

00:00:02.567 --> 00:00:04.100
"Well, that headline
could be better

00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:05.834
than what it is with the photo"?

00:00:05.834 --> 00:00:07.067
Well, we're gonna
take care of that right now.

00:00:07.067 --> 00:00:08.467
It's time
for "News and Improved."

00:00:08.467 --> 00:00:10.434
Here we go.

00:00:10.434 --> 00:00:13.834
-♪ News and Improved ♪

00:00:13.834 --> 00:00:16.834
♪♪

00:00:16.834 --> 00:00:19.000
-For example, check out
this first photo here.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:20.601
The original headline was...

00:00:24.267 --> 00:00:25.601
The headline
can definitely be improved

00:00:25.601 --> 00:00:27.067
because if you only looked
at the photo,

00:00:27.067 --> 00:00:28.334
the headline could have been...

00:00:29.901 --> 00:00:31.734
[ Laughter ]

00:00:31.734 --> 00:00:33.334
-Pumpkin head!

00:00:36.067 --> 00:00:37.400
-Up next, this headline says...

00:00:40.968 --> 00:00:42.033
Headline could have been...

00:00:44.234 --> 00:00:45.467
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:45.467 --> 00:00:48.100
"Oh, yes!"

00:00:48.100 --> 00:00:50.234
Impossible.

00:00:50.234 --> 00:00:51.534
This headline was...

00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:55.767
Headline could've been...

00:00:59.601 --> 00:01:01.267
He's like...

00:01:04.667 --> 00:01:05.667
-[ Clicks tongue ]

00:01:05.667 --> 00:01:06.801
-Next headline was...

00:01:10.434 --> 00:01:11.467
Headline could've been...

00:01:14.133 --> 00:01:16.234
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:17.234 --> 00:01:19.601
-[ Slurps ]

00:01:19.601 --> 00:01:20.901
-This next headline was...

00:01:24.367 --> 00:01:25.400
Headline could've been...

00:01:28.834 --> 00:01:30.834
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:34.434 --> 00:01:35.501
The next headline was...

00:01:38.234 --> 00:01:39.267
Headline could've been...

00:01:41.801 --> 00:01:44.300
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:44.300 --> 00:01:47.067
[ Spits ]

00:01:47.067 --> 00:01:48.300
Next headline was...

00:01:51.501 --> 00:01:52.767
The headline could've been...

00:01:55.634 --> 00:01:58.701
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:58.701 --> 00:02:01.000
They look good.

00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:02.100
This next headline was...

00:02:05.767 --> 00:02:07.133
Headline could've been...

00:02:10.734 --> 00:02:12.734
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:15.567 --> 00:02:17.501
And finally,
this headline was

00:02:17.501 --> 00:02:19.934
Team Cuba competes
on artistic gymna--

00:02:19.934 --> 00:02:22.734
