00:02:24.400 --> 00:02:25.601
-[ Laughs ]

00:02:25.601 --> 00:02:26.467
Uh-oh.

00:02:26.467 --> 00:02:27.767
-Headline could've been,

00:02:27.767 --> 00:02:31.300
"Taco Bell's Volcano Taco
is back, baby!"

00:02:31.300 --> 00:02:33.300
That's all the time
we have for "News and Improved."

00:02:33.300 --> 00:02:36.434
Stick around. We'll be right
back with some amazing talents

00:02:36.434 --> 00:02:38.400
